			description: [
				"&2储物抽屉&r能让你存放大量1-4种物品。1x1抽屉容量最大，可存放一种物品的&22048&r个。其次是2x2抽屉，可存放两种物品的&21024&r个。最后是4x4抽屉，可存放四种物品的&2512&r个。如果你有大量想储存的物品（比如圆石），不妨多备几个。"
				""
				"&2&o&lALSO,&r&r&r if you wish to craft framed drawers or anything that needs drawers, you need to use oak drawers. These can be made either with 2 oak planks and GT planks, or 4 GT planks, so no matter where you spawn, you can always craft one. This is because I can't be bothered to add tags to all drawers, and will be fixed in the next minor update if enough people complain about it."
